<title>USA: EMCEE Broadcast Products Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>EMCEE Broadcast Products Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE HAVEN, Pa. 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMCEE BROADCAST PRODUCTS INC</p>
<p>Three and Twelve Months Ended March 31, 1996 and 1997</p>
<p>			  TWELVE MONTHS ENDING  THREE MONTHS ENDING</p>
<p>			03/31/97     03/31/96   03/31/97   03/31/96</p>
<p> Net sales	$12,522,811 $14,292,562 $1,881,721 $4,769,033</p>
<p> Net income	 3,015,902   1,595,086  1,690,393    686,045</p>
